menu "TamaOrb board"
choice TAMAORB_BOARD
    prompt "Target board"
    default TAMAORB_BOARD_SPOTPEAR_BALL_128
config TAMAORB_BOARD_SPOTPEAR_BALL_128
    bool "SpotPear 1.28\" AI Voice Robot Ball (ESP32-S3, GC9A01A, CST816D, ES8311)"
endchoice
config TAMAORB_VOLUME
    int "Speaker volume (0 = muted)"
    range 0 100
    default 1
    help
        1 is the quietest setting. While unmuted the speaker amp stays on (switching it per beep
        swallowed the short key clicks), which leaves a faint hum, inaudible from 10 cm.
        0 mutes the sound and switches the amp off.
endmenu
